<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - Oce first-half net NLG 103.1 mln.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Oce first-half net NLG 103.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>VENLO, Netherlands 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31,</p>
<p>1997 (in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     4.99 vs   4.04</p>
<p>    Net profit			   103.1  vs  68.6</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  2.52 vs   1.79</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   195.3  vs 137.2</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    57.2  vs  51.9</p>
<p>    Tax				     32.3  vs  17.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected copier maker Oce NV to report a first-half net profit of 94.9 to 109 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Interest income from leases     74.6  vs  60.0</p>
<p>    Associates' income		   0.1  vs   0.3</p>
<p>    Minorities interests charge	2.8  vs   nil</p>
<p>    Dividend on preference shares    3.9  vs   nil</p>
<p>Net attributable to</p>
<p>    ordinary shareholders	     99.2  vs  68.6</p>
<p>    Cash flow			    271.0  vs 205.5</p>
<p>    Cash flow per shr (guilders)    13.43 vs  12.08</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
